      "description": "Upgrades a domain controller using the Microsoft-prescribed parallel paradigm: provision a new DC at the target Windows Server version via EC2, wait for AD replication, transfer FSMO roles, validate the new DC, then demote the old DC. Full rollback at every phase.",
